Recommends: kelvincal-plasmoid, colord
Description: display calibration for KDE Plasma (DDC/CI and ArgyllCMS)
 KelvinCal calibrates displays under KDE Plasma on Wayland. It sets the white
 point and brightness in the display's own hardware over DDC/CI, measures an
 ICC profile with ArgyllCMS and activates it in KWin. Presets switch
 brightness, contrast, RGB gains and ICC profile of all displays at once.

Package: kelvincal-plasmoid
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kelvincal (= ${binary:Version}), plasma-workspace
Description: KelvinCal preset switcher for the Plasma panel
 Panel widget that switches KelvinCal display presets with one click and
 warns when a display no longer matches the active preset.
